        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I noticed that my main electric wire coming into the house was somewhat burnt/melted when I was collecting fallen branches from my roof. I took some pictures and sent to Baz via email. They immediately reacted and called me back and scheduled a visit the very next morning. Team has showed up on time, made some surveys, called hydro-quebec, and fixed my burnt cables very quickly before the lunch time including the hydro’s main power off and on working time.  The team, both office and technicians were super. Thank you BAZ, really appreciated your work highly.",
        "time": 1716213434,
        "translated": false
      },
